 62, https://www.korg.com/us/support/download/manual/0/104/1616/."}],"testedWith":[],"authoringNotes":["Generated by tools/profiles/korg/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/korg/synths/, not this file.","Every parameter is a control change the document says the instrument recognises, or a row of its NRPN table, with its printed name. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.","Not a parameter here, Data Entry, part of the NRPN messages: CC 6.","Not a parameter here, an NRPN or RPN selector, part of the NRPN messages: CC 98, 99.","Not a parameter here, a channel mode message: CC 120, 121, 123, 124, 125, 126, 127.","41 panel knobs and switches on the control changes the Owner's Manual (p. 56) gives them from the factory; the MIDI Implementation calls them assignable (GLOBAL's Knob & Switch Ctrl Change No. Map), so an instrument set otherwise needs its own. Names and sections are the MIDI Implementation's, each knob found there by its name; values, and what each sends, the Owner's Manual's.","CC 18, 19, 83, 74, 85, 10 mean one thing in a synth program and another in a vocoder program; each is two parameters, the second in the Vocoder group, and is not attributed to either when the instrument sends it.","The two documents name some knobs differently; the MIDI Implementation's names are used: CC 79 is \"Filter EG Int\" in the Owner's Manual, \"EG1 Int\" in the MIDI Implementation; CC 90 is \"Sync Ctrl\" in the Owner's Manual, \"Sync Control\" in the MIDI Implementation."],"identity":{"manufacturerId":["42"],"familyCode":["58","00"],"modelNumber":["11","00"],"timeoutMs":1000,"retries":0},"coverage":{"singleParameterWrite":"complete-for-the-document's-control-changes-and-nrpns","realtimeEditing":"complete-for-the-document's-control-changes-and-nrpns","editBufferDumpRequest":"notImplemented: the program dump is described but not mapped yet","editBufferDumpParse":"notImplemented","bankDump":"notImplemented","inboundControllers":"the front panel se